TSM vgui.dll patch -- H9's purple VGUI1 scheme (Steam Half-Life / GoldSrc)
==========================================================================

What this is: Valve's VGUI1 library (Half-Life\vgui.dll) with the six scheme colours that
Scheme::Scheme() compiles in changed to H9's purple. 18 bytes; nothing else in the file
differs. TS's in-game VGUI1 menus (team, class, buy, the command menus) take these through
Scheme::sc_primary1..3 and sc_secondary1..3, and no .res or .txt file can set them -- the
menu text colours come from ts\<width>_textscheme.txt instead, which H9 ships separately.

